            "source_url": "https://physionet.org/content/siena-scalp-eeg/1.0.0/",
            "file_format": "EDF",
            "description": "14 adult epilepsy patients (Unit of Neurology and Neurophysiology, University of Siena), 41 continuous video-EEG recordings (~128 h), 512 Hz, 29 scalp EEG channels, 47 annotated seizures.",
